eblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/6827320/001-e517cb75c4.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/6827320/001-e517cb75c4.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"639\" height=\"390\"></a></figure></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">后来才知道</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">这天东京竟然有34度！</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">难怪这么热（笑）</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/6827320/002-e87bca9e18.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/6827320/002-e87bca9e18.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n蓝天和喷水让人感觉真舒服！\n\n<br>\n\n\n到了之后马上！\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/6827320/003-534718cc94.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/6827320/003-534718cc94.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"358\" height=\"614\"></a></figure>\n\n第一次遇到化石盔！！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/6827320/004-b5557cbd71.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/6827320/004-b5557cbd71.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"357\" height=\"614\"></a></figure>\n\n它正看着这边\n超级可爱的嘛！！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/6827320/005-f786941495.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/6827320/005-f786941495.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"358\" height=\"602\"></a></figure>\n\n抓到了！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n顺便把公园里的\n所有宝可梦补给站\n都去了一遍！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n结果那里竟然有……\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/6827320/006-cb61764d37.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/6827320/006-cb61764d37.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"639\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n竟然有D51！\n这是一辆因“Degoichi”这个昵称而闻名的\n我最喜欢的机车！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n没想到\n世田谷公园里居然有D51……\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n总之先留个纪念……\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/6827320/007-807ab7ba5f.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/6827320/007-807ab7ba5f.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"358\" height=\"611\"></a></figure>\n\n插了个模块（笑）\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n再移动了1小时……\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/6827320/008-acc59a923a.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/6827320/008-acc59a923a.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"621\" height=\"840\"></a></figure>\n\n首次抓到帅气的飞天螳螂！\n还登记到道馆了哦！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n然后……结果……\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/6827320/009-64332e6943.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/6827320/009-64332e6943.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"358\" height=\"598\"></a></figure>\n\n化石盔有3只！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n想要进化的话\n前路还很长\n不过也因此了解了世田谷公园，已经非常满足了！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n这里是个相当宽敞\n让人感觉很舒服的公园\n所以我也打算\n推荐给 GAME FREAK 的员工们！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/6827320/010-0c78a11233.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/6827320/010-0c78a11233.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"438\" height=\"747\"></a></figure>\n\n听说周末还会有迷你蒸汽火车运行！\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n我还会再来抓化石盔的！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n下回再见啦！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n（附带内容）\n从世田谷公园\n回 GAME FREAK 的路上\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/6827320/011-88e6aaa5c8.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/6827320/011-88e6aaa5c8.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"355\" height=\"617\"></a></figure>\n\n竟然有两只卡蒂狗！\n\n<br>\n\n\n感觉它们好像在保护我\n真是特别开心（笑）\n\n<br></div>","markdown_ja":"<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">カブト捕まえたくて</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">初めて世田谷公園に！</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">実は</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">ゲームフリークのある三軒茶屋から</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">歩いて20分ぐらいで行けるんだけど</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">なかなか行く機会がなかった！</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/6827320/001-e517cb75c4.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/6827320/001-e517cb75c4.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"639\" height=\"390\"></a></figure></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">後で知ったけど</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">この日の東京は34度！</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">そりゃ暑いわけだ（笑）</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/6827320/002-e87bca9e18.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/6827320/002-e87bca9e18.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n青空と噴水が気持ちいい！\n\n<br>\n\n\n到着してすぐに！\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/6827320/003-534718cc94.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/6827320/003-534718cc94.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"358\" height=\"614\"></a></figure>\n\n初 カブト！！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/6827320/004-b5557cbd71.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/6827320/004-b5557cbd71.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"357\" height=\"614\"></a></figure>\n\nこっち見てて\n超 愛らしいんですけど！！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/6827320/005-f786941495.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/6827320/005-f786941495.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"358\" height=\"602\"></a></figure>\n\n捕まえた！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nせっかくなので\n公園内の全ての\nポケストップに寄ってみた！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nするとそこには何と・・\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/6827320/006-cb61764d37.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/6827320/006-cb61764d37.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"639\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\nD51が！\nデゴイチという愛称で有名な\n大好きな機関車！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nまさか\n世田谷公園にD51があるとは・・・\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nとりあえず記念に・・・\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/6827320/007-807ab7ba5f.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/6827320/007-807ab7ba5f.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"358\" height=\"611\"></a></figure>\n\nモジュール刺した（笑）\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nさらに\n移動すること1時間・・・\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/6827320/008-acc59a923a.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/6827320/008-acc59a923a.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"621\" height=\"840\"></a></figure>\n\nかっこいいストライクを初ゲット！\nジムに登録もしたよ！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nそして・・・結果・・・\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/6827320/009-64332e6943.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/6827320/009-64332e6943.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"358\" height=\"598\"></a></figure>\n\nカブトは3匹！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n進化させるには\n先は長いけど\n世田谷公園の事を知れたので大満足！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nなかなか広くて\n気持ち良い公園なので\nゲームフリークスタッフにも\nオススメしようと思いました！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/6827320/010-0c78a11233.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/6827320/010-0c78a11233.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"438\" height=\"747\"></a></figure>\n\n土日はミニSLも走るみたいです！\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nまたカブト捕まえに\n行きたいと思います！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nチャオ！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n（オマケ）\n世田谷公園から\nゲームフリークに戻る時\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/6827320/011-88e6aaa5c8.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/6827320/011-88e6aaa5c8.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"355\" height=\"617\"></a></figure>\n\nダブル ガーディが！\n\n<br>\n\n\n何だか守ってくれているみたいで\nとっても嬉しい（笑）\n\n<br></div>"}}